---
// TactileMechanics.astro - Ambient Video Loop & Tactile Philosophy
---

<section id="mechanics" class="relative w-full py-28 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-[#0A0A0A] border-b border-white/[0.08] overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Subtle ambient glow -->
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-1/4 w-[600px] h-[300px] bg-neutral-800/10 blur-[130px] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto relative z-10">
    <!-- Section Kicker & Title Header -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] text-[11px] font-mono tracking-widest text-[#A3A3A3] uppercase mb-4">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-neutral-300"></span>
        03 / CONTROL TÁCTIL & FILOSOFÍA ANALÓGICA
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white mb-5 leading-tight">
        La memoria en la punta de tus dedos.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-neutral-300 font-light leading-relaxed">
        Sin menús laberínticos ni distracciones en pantalla. Cada parámetro esencial posee su propio control físico tallado en aluminio macizo.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 2-Column Split: Ambient Video Frame & Tactile Pillars -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center">
      <!-- Left Column: Cinematic Video Frame (7 Cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <div class="relative rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-neutral-950/80 overflow-hidden shadow-2xl group">
          <!-- Glass reflection line top -->
          <div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/20 to-transparent z-20"></div>

          <!-- Video element -->
          <div class="aspect-video w-full relative">
            <video
              id="dials-video"
              src="/videos/dials-ambient.mp4"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover filter brightness-[0.95] contrast-[1.05]"
              autoplay
              loop
              muted
              playsinline
              preload="metadata"
            ></video>

            <!-- Video ambient overlay badge -->
            <div class="absolute top-4 left-4 z-20 flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 text-[10px] font-mono text-neutral-300">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
              <span>MACRO CINEMA · 24 FPS</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Video technical specs badge bottom -->
            <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 z-20 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 p-3 rounded-xl bg-black/70 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/10 text-[11px] font-mono text-neutral-300">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <span class="text-white font-semibold">ALUMINIO 6061-T6</span>
                <span class="text-neutral-500">|</span>
                <span>TOLERANCIA ±0.01 mm</span>
              </div>
              <button
                id="video-toggle-btn"
                type="button"
                class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-[10px] text-white transition-colors cursor-pointer"
                aria-label="Pausar o reanudar video de diales"
              >
                Pausar
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: 3 Tactile Pillars (5 Cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col gap-5">
        <!-- Pillar 1 -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.02] hover:bg-white/[0.04] hover:border-white/15 transition-all duration-200">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
            <h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-white">
              Diales Concéntricos Duales
            </h3>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-neutral-400">
              ISO / VELOCIDAD
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-neutral-300 font-light leading-relaxed">
            Ajusta la velocidad de obturación y levanta el collar exterior para calibrar la sensibilidad ISO en un solo mecanismo mecánico retráctil inspirado en la época dorada de las cámaras analógicas.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Pillar 2 -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.02] hover:bg-white/[0.04] hover:border-white/15 transition-all duration-200">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
            <h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-white">
              Visor Híbrido OVF / EVF
            </h3>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-neutral-400">
              3.69M PUNTOS
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-neutral-300 font-light leading-relaxed">
            Alterna en milisegundos con la palanca frontal entre el encuadre óptico telemétrico con líneas de corrección de paralaje y la pantalla OLED de ultra-alta definición para verificar exposición en tiempo real.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Pillar 3 -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.02] hover:bg-white/[0.04] hover:border-white/15 transition-all duration-200">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
            <h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-white">
              Ergonomía de Bolsillo
            </h3>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-neutral-400">
              521 GRAMOS
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-neutral-300 font-light leading-relaxed">
            Placas superior e inferior de aluminio mecanizado con recubrimiento anodizado ultra-resistente. Un peso de apenas 521 g listo para acompañarte durante jornadas enteras de fotografía callejera.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  const dialsVideo = document.getElementById('dials-video') as HTMLVideoElement | null;
  const videoToggleBtn = document.getElementById('video-toggle-btn');

  if (dialsVideo && videoToggleBtn) {
    videoToggleBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      if (dialsVideo.paused) {
        dialsVideo.play();
        videoToggleBtn.textContent = 'Pausar';
      } else {
        dialsVideo.pause();
        videoToggleBtn.textContent = 'Reanudar';
      }
    });
  }
</script>
